     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear all,<br></div><div><br></div><div>I have searched how to calculate the Monte Carlo confidence intervals for indirect effect, and found the below code, and it worked, however, I do not know how to calculate  the Monte Carlo confidence intervals for direct effect, total effect, and the proportion mediated(indirect effect/total effect).</div><div><br></div><font face=\"ms song, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">set</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">seed</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">1234</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>X </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">100</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>M </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">0.5</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">*</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">X </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">+</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">100</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>Y </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">0.7</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">*</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">M </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">+</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">100</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">Data</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> data</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">frame</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">X </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> X</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> Y </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> Y</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> M </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> M</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>model </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&#39; # direct effect<br>Y ~ c*X<br># mediator<br>M ~ a*X<br>Y ~ b*M<br># indirect effect (a*b)<br>ab := a*b<br># total effect<br>total := c + (a*b)<br>prop := ab/total<br></span></font><div><font face=\"ms song, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>fit </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> sem</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">model</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> data </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">Data</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span></font></div><div><font face=\"ms song, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></font>#Monte Carlo confidence intervals for indirect effect<font face=\"ms song, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>med </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&#39;a*b&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>myParams </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> c</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&quot;a&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&quot;b&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>myCoefs </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> coef</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">fit</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)[</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">myParams</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">]</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>myACM </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> vcov</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">fit</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)[</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">myParams</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> myParams</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">]</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>monteCarloMed</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">med</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> myCoefs</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> ACM </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"> myACM</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span></font><br></div><div><font face=\"ms song, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></font></div><div>Thank you so much in advance.<font face=\"ms song, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"ms song, monospace\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">best,</span></font></div></div>"
